  "title": "Small-Batch Sugar Cookie Ice Cream Sandwiches",
  "description": "These sugar cookie ice cream sandwiches are a fast summer treat. You can use any sugar cookie recipe, but the sugar cookie recipe here will make enough for 6 ice cream sandwiches.",
